Hi Greg,

I recognize that kind of error but it was fixed many months ago. I haven't submitted a new official version to CRAN just yet (will do soon) but in the meantime, you could try installing the latest development version:
install.packages("QCA", repos = "dusadrian.r-universe.dev <http://dusadrian.r-universe.dev>")

Otherwise, if the error persists or you have some other such difficulties, please send a reproducible example (consider sending it privately if your data is sensitive).

With all my best,
Adrian

